{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17088","headline":"和黄门相公诏还题石门洞 · 郑余庆","name":"和黄门相公诏还题石门洞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫氛随马处，黄阁驻车情。\n嵌壑惊山势，周滩恋水声。\n地分三蜀限，关志百牢名。\n琬琰攀酬郢，微言鼎饪情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑余庆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17088.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17088","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}